Creamy Garlic Pasta,"200 g pasta, 3 garlic cloves, 2 tbsp olive oil, 100 ml cream, 50 g parmesan, 1 tsp salt, black pepper",20.0,"1. Boil the pasta in salted water for 10 minutes, then drain.
2. Heat the olive oil in a pan and fry the garlic for 1 minute.
3. Add the cream and simmer for 3 minutes.
4. Mix in the parmesan until the sauce is smooth.
5. Add the pasta, toss well and season with salt and pepper.",Easy,,Dinner,2.0,
Fluffy Pancakes,"200 g flour, 2 tbsp sugar, 1 tsp baking powder, 250 ml milk, 1 egg, 2 tbsp butter, pinch of salt",25.0,"1. Mix the flour, sugar, baking powder and salt in a bowl.
2. Whisk the milk, egg and melted butter in another bowl.
3. Pour the wet mix into the dry mix and stir until just combined.
4. Heat a lightly oiled pan on medium heat.
5. Pour about 1/4 cup of batter and cook 2 minutes per side until golden.",Easy,,"Dessert, Breakfast",4.0,
Chocolate Lava Cake,"100 g dark chocolate, 100 g butter, 2 eggs, 2 egg yolks, 80 g sugar, 40 g flour, 1 tsp vanilla extract",30.0,"1. Preheat the oven to 220 C and grease 4 small ramekins.
2. Melt the chocolate and butter together and let cool slightly.
3. Whisk the eggs, egg yolks and sugar until pale and thick.
4. Fold the chocolate mixture into the eggs, then fold in the flour and vanilla.
5. Divide the batter between the ramekins.
6. Bake for 10 minutes until the edges are set but the center is soft.
7. Rest for 1 minute, turn out onto a plate and serve warm.",Medium,,Dessert,4.0,
Beef Lasagna,"250 g lasagna sheets, 400 g minced beef, 1 onion, 2 garlic cloves, 400 g canned tomatoes, 2 tbsp tomato paste, 300 ml milk, 40 g butter, 40 g flour, 150 g mozzarella, 1/2 tsp salt, black pepper",90.0,"1. Preheat the oven to 190 C.
2. Fry the chopped onion and garlic, add the beef and cook until browned.
3. Stir in the tomatoes, tomato paste, salt and pepper and simmer for 20 minutes.
4. Melt the butter, whisk in the flour, then slowly add the milk and stir until thick.
5. In a baking dish, layer meat sauce, lasagna sheets and white sauce. Repeat 3 times.
6. Top with mozzarella.
7. Bake for 40 minutes until golden and bubbling.
8. Rest for 10 minutes before cutting.",Hard,,Dinner,6.0,https://youtu.be/VkQajdYciW0?si=9VbLF2o9jlxRuQtD
Greek Chicken Salad,"300 g chicken breast, 2 tbsp olive oil, 1 cucumber, 2 tomatoes, 100 g feta cheese, 50 g black olives, 1 red onion, 1 tbsp lemon juice, 1 tsp oregano, salt",25.0,"1. Season the chicken with oregano, salt and half of the olive oil.
2. Grill or pan-fry the chicken for 6 minutes per side until cooked through, then rest for 5 minutes.
3. Chop the cucumber, tomatoes and red onion into bite-size pieces.
4. Mix the vegetables and olives in a large bowl.
5. Whisk the remaining olive oil with the lemon juice and pour over the salad.
6. Slice the chicken, place it on top and crumble the feta over it.",Easy,,Healthy,2.0,https://youtu.be/Tc7ttfjKi9k?si=fWAFtNM-cfmGANIL
